<!--
  Sitemap for immob24.com. Public: robots.txt allows crawling and every
  indexable page emits <meta robots: index, follow>. Only canonical,
  indexable, 200-status marketing pages are listed here.

  Deliberately EXCLUDED:
  - the post-conversion beta thank-you pages (noindex)
  - /dev/* scratch routes (noindex)
  - every redirect URL. The old /{lang}/how-it-works, /{lang}/demo and
    beta-programme slugs are 301'd by nginx-spa.conf to their merged
    destinations, so listing them would point Google at redirects. They
    were listed here by mistake until 2026-07-31 — this file had not been
    regenerated since the unified-IA rework deleted those pages, so it
    advertised 6 dead URLs and none of the new ones.
  - the bare root: nginx 301s / to /de, so /de is the canonical entry.

  hreflang is intentionally NOT declared in this sitemap. Each page's
  HTML head already emits <link rel="alternate" hreflang> via the
  usePageMeta hook, which Google treats as equivalent. Keeping the
  sitemap in the plain sitemap-0.9 namespace also lets Chrome's
  built-in XML tree viewer render it nicely in a browser.
-->
